  "content": "\n\n![實際 3D 附魔戰鎚標誌](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/31ed037cfb314b68814e4c0f38c8f63b3f8e4f90.png)\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/matej_sicha/tiers\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a117255e81bca7499d1de036461f8ee3da544de4.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi 按鈕\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/qjlkcVfy\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2782a154f927e6ea480e6340cb8098535df2ec36.png\" alt=\"Modrinth 按鈕\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJqmSYqyuu\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/853614de62c5a1c45ac308af46b50e30aca91f8e.png\" alt=\"Discord 按鈕\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</center>\n\n____\n\n![此資源包為戰鎚添加了依附魔而變化的模型！（密度附魔系列圖片）附魔變體相互疊加，總共可產生 2880 種可能的組合！（烈焰附魔、風爆與修補術變體圖片）（玩家手持附魔戰鎚站在懸崖邊的照片，附有文字「查看更多圖片畫廊」）影片展示： ](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a4d89f06cfd5dd9265243307cf94d2afef6802e.png)\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qyvepuPqWTc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n![所有變體：（展示所有附魔模型的表格）](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e932efaf2b100136d487e03b5b9352d21ab9923.png)\n\n____\n\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c5619ba551772802195b68570307715056bd48ad.png\" alt=\"使用條款\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\">\n</center>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用條款</summary>\n\n\n\n<center>\n<font size=\"5\">  \n    <b>使用本資源包即表示您同意遵守以下規則。</b> \n</font>\n</center>\n\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n# <center>您可以</center>\n\n<center>\n<font size=\"4\">  \n    <b>- 在您的 Modrinth 整合包中使用本資源包（需註明出處）</b> \n</font>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<font size=\"4\">  \n    <b>- 在 YouTube 影片及其他社群媒體上使用本資源包</b> \n</font>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<font size=\"4\">  \n